# Directory spec for the `operator` crate: the reconciling Kubernetes controller.
# Submodules are specified by nearer same-basename specs.

Spec: operator

Platform: Rust/Kubernetes

Purpose:
  The Vynil controller. It watches the four custom resources, caches packages from JukeBox
  scans, selects the package for each instance, checks requirements, and renders and applies
  the Job that runs the agent. It also serves Prometheus metrics and health over Actix on
  port 9000.

Structure:
  ./src/main.rs: Entrypoint, Actix metrics/health server, controller wiring
  ./src/lib.rs: Library root re-exporting the controllers and `@InstanceKind`
  ./src/manager.rs: `@Manager` shared context and the four controllers
  ./src/instance_common.rs: `@InstanceKind` trait and the shared `@do_reconcile`/`@do_cleanup`
    algorithm
  ./src/{instanceservice,instancesystem,instancetenant}.rs: Per-kind `@InstanceKind` impls
  ./src/jukebox.rs: JukeBox scan reconciliation and package cache update
  ./src/metrics.rs: Prometheus registries and reconciliation metrics
  ./src/telemetry.rs: OpenTelemetry tracing, behind the `telemetry` feature
  ./templates/: Job and scan Job Handlebars templates
  ./parent.toml: Standalone workspace manifest for the image build (generated)
  ./Dockerfile: Runtime image build (contract in ./Dockerfile.sdd)

Owns:
  ./src/main.rs
  ./src/lib.rs
  ./src/manager.rs
  ./src/instance_common.rs
  ./src/instanceservice.rs
  ./src/instancesystem.rs
  ./src/instancetenant.rs
  ./src/jukebox.rs
  ./src/metrics.rs
  ./src/telemetry.rs
  ./Cargo.toml
  ./parent.toml
  ./templates/**

Must:
  Reconcile all three instance kinds through the single `@InstanceKind` algorithm, so new kinds
    share install, requirement-check, and cleanup behaviour.
  Requeue an instance every 15 minutes and honour the suspend and force-reinstall control
    annotations.
  Render every Job through Handlebars templates in `./templates/`.
  Expose reconciliation duration, success/failure counters, and last-event timestamp on
    `GET /metrics`.

Must not:
  Deploy or uninstall applications directly; the controller only creates the Job that launches
    the agent.
  Depend on the `agent` or `server` crates.

Depends on:
  ./common/common.sdd
  `kube`, `k8s-openapi`, `actix-web`, `prometheus-client`

References:
  ./src/main.sdd, ./src/lib.sdd, ./src/manager.sdd, ./src/instance_common.sdd,
    ./src/instanceservice.sdd, ./src/instancesystem.sdd, ./src/instancetenant.sdd,
    ./src/jukebox.sdd, ./src/metrics.sdd, ./src/telemetry.sdd — the file-level contracts;
    this directory spec stays coarse and defers all file behavior to them.

Done when:
  `./src/instance_common.rs` and each per-kind module have reviewed specs, and
    `cargo test -p operator` is green.

Tasks:
  [x] #0 Spec `./src/instance_common.rs` (the shared reconcile/cleanup algorithm and annotations).
  [x] #1 Spec `./src/jukebox.rs` and the three per-kind impl modules.
  [x] #2 Spec `./src/manager.rs` and `./src/metrics.rs`.
